                                    <p>Industry standard: Minimum 15-20 variations per campaign, testing hooks (5 variations), avatars (3-4 variations), and CTAs (3 variations). With AdMaker's unlimited model at $39/mo, high-performing advertisers test 30-50 variations monthly. Meta's 2026 algorithm favors accounts that refresh creatives every 3-5 days to combat ad fatigue.</p>
